      { label: 'HL: motivation, appraisal and culture', request: 'Explain McClelland’s acquired needs theory, Deci and Ryan’s self-determination theory, and Charles Handy’s “Gods of Management” organizational culture framework.' },
      { label: 'HL: industrial employee relations', request: 'Explain the difference between employee approaches (like collective bargaining, work-to-rule and strike action) and employer approaches (like lockouts and redundancy threats) to workplace conflict, and how conflict can be resolved.' }
